// 每周计划), the 产品设计 conversation of 02/B01/B04/B09/B38/H01, the
// contacts and strangers of 07/F17, the agents Nova, Atlas and Mira of
// 04/D01/D40 with Nova's three approval cards, the task of 06/E01/E05, the
// files of the H01 dock and the devices of G08.
//
// Epoch: 2026-11-10 10:00 UTC (captures run with TZ=UTC). Moment offsets are
// signed offsets from the epoch: 09:41 is -1140000. The board's list shows
// 周宁 "昨天", 发布协调 "周一" and 每周计划 "11/08"; with 11-10 as today
// the first two both fall on yesterday.
